OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mozart
OL,6,     F1/1. Kate Molleson tells Mozart's
OL,7,     Fstory through five of the
OL,8,     Frelationships that shaped the
OL,9,     Fcomposer and his music - from his
OL,10,     Ffriends and family to a mentor and
OL,11,     Fa supposed rival.
OL,12,G1700 In Tune
OL,13,     FKatie chats to Alexandra Dariescu
OL,14,     Fand Jacob Muhlrad about their BBC
OL,15,     FProms.
OL,16,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,17,     FLive at the BBC Proms: the Royal
OL,18,     FScottish National Orchestra and
OL,19,     Fconductor Thomas SC8ndergard are
OL,20,     Fjoined by pianist Kirill Gerstein
OL,21,     Fin Rachmaninov's 'Paganini'
OL,22,     FVariations.
