OL,5,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,7,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,8,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,9,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,10,     Feverything in between.
OL,11,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,12,     FThis week, London based singer,
OL,13,     Fviolinist and composer Alice
OL,14,     FZawadzki is sitting in for Soweto
OL,15,     FKinch, sharing some exciting jazz
OL,16,     Freleases from the UK and around
OL,17,     Fthe world.
OL,18,G0030 Through the Night
OL,19,     FTalented young soloists, violinist
OL,20,     FLudvig Gudim and pianist Valdemar
OL,21,     FWenzel Most perform a recital at
OL,22,     Fthe church in Nyborg, Denmark.
